<!-- A debuggable build only. It may read the notice about people's information from a local copy served over plain HTTP
     on the emulator's address for the host machine, 10.0.2.2, so the card can be looked at without publishing a notice
     (docs/runbooks/CLIENT_ANDROID.md). A release build keeps Android's default, HTTPS only. -->
